  abilityName: Sunbow Fantasy
  abilityDesc: 27 combo Earth attack on all foes (uses all allies' BB gauges), boosts
    all elemental damage for 4 turns, fills BB gauge for 4 turns, boosts Atk, Def,
    Rec relative to max HP for 4 turns, fills OD gauge & raises allies from KO
